Package: crossform
Title: Cross-Generalized Effect Geometry
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "bradley.buchsbaum@gmail.com")
Description: Gives univariate contrasts, multivariate distances and fixed
    linear representational similarity analysis, and population summaries one
    declared crossvalidated bilinear geometry. Reproducible effects are
    decomposed across spatial scales into additive coherent and configurational
    estimand components. Spatial measurements, independent partitions,
    realized population transports, units, support diagnostics, uncertainty
    capabilities, execution receipts, and principled refusals remain explicit.
    It is not a preprocessing system or a universal fMRI, RSA, prediction, or
    downstream-inference solution.
